WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.010
For centuries, Muslim rulers
carried the title caliph:

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:07.170
the successor, or
deputy, of the Messenger,

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.200
leading the Muslim community.

4
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:13.040
Then, in 1924, the
caliphate was abolished,

5
00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:14.980
and the title was gone.

6
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.910
For 1,300 years there was a caliph.

7
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.670
So what did a caliph actually do?

8
00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.420
In this mission, you'll
hear a famous saying:

9
00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:28.930
the caliphate would last thirty
years, and then kingship would follow.

10
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.170
Then you'll compare the Sunni
caliph with the Shi'a Imam,

11
00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.710
side by side.

12
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.600
Your mission: find out
what a caliph was for,

13
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.840
and whether later caliphs lived up to it.
